#AREA Kingdom of Isles~
#AUTHORS Jaxom~


#HELPS
-1 KINGDOM_CHANGES~
12.25.04 - The following messages were logged on a regular basis.
             [*****] BUG: Mpat - No such location: vnum 1715.
             [*****] BUG: Mpat - No such location: vnum 1714.
           I found it was caused by mobs 1714 and 1715 using an mpat mpforce on
           the dukecrydeequestmob to cause him to shout.  When the questmob was
           killed and the other mobs tried to mpforce it.  The bug was present.
           I couldn't reproduce the conditions in which the questmob was killed.
           To correct the problem I changed all related mpat mpforce commands to
           mpareaecho.  This resolves the bug issue and still maintains the
           intent of the area writer. (Mag)
12.25.04 - 24 spelling corrections. (Mag)
~
-1 KINGDOMQUESTS~
Quests in the Kingdom of Isles

The quests in this area are for level 90 equipment.  All but one of the
quest items are for Neutral characters, and the one is Anti-Good.  Beware
as the area is aggressive to those on a quest.
~
-1 'KINGDOM OF ISLES' KINGDOM ISLES~
{140}Kingdom of Isles{060}
{170}----------------{300}

{140}The Kingdom of Isles lived mostly at peace with the occasional raid from its
neighbor to the south.  One day a young boy discovered a strange ship beached
upon its western shore, and that signaled the beginning of the invasion.  A
nation from another world had opened a rift to the Kingdom of Isles and,
desirous of the rich metals available in the kingdom, quickly invaded.  Thus
began the Riftwar.  Based on the series by Raymond E. Fiest.

(a){300} {170}Jaxom
{140}(b) Quests{100}

Last updated August 20, 1998{300}

{a}JAXOM
{b}KINGDOMQUESTS
~
0 $~





#RANGES 75 95 0 99
#MOBILES
#1700
blacksmith crydee~
the Crydee Blacksmith~
The blacksmith of Crydee is here.
~
He is a large muscular man and looks every inch the blacksmith from his
calloused fingers to his soot smeared brow.
~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
0 
0 S
50 0 0 1d1+5000 1d1+100
2 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 10~
mpasound You hear the ring of a blacksmith's hammer nearby.
if rand(30)
  mpecho The sword the blacksmith is working on sizzles as he cools it in water.
else
  if rand(30)
    mpecho The anvil rings loudly as the blacksmith pounds at it with his hammer.
  else
    mpecho The sword glows red as the blacksmith pulls it from the forge.
  endif
endif
~
>greet_prog 40~
smile $n
say What can i do for ya?
~
|
#1701
dukecrydeequestmob crydee~
the Duke of Crydee~
The Duke of Crydee is here.~
He is a large muscular man and looks every inch the frontier duke from his
calloused fingers to his crows feet brow.
~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
0 
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+17000 1d1+150
1000000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>speech_prog prince message~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 11
  say I was afraid that message would not get through.
  say Tell my son that the invaders are beginning to overwhelm
  say our forces.  He must bring reinforcements by spring.
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 12
endif
~
|
#1702
swordmaster crydee~
the Crydee swordmaster~
The swordmaster of Crydee is here.~
He is a large muscular man and looks every inch the swordsman from his
calloused fingers to his scared arms.
~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_TRAIN|ACT_PRACTICE 0 
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+15000 1d1+150
100000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 7
  say Well met $n.  I have heard much about you.
  say Shall we begin this test?
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 8
else
  if quest(0, 3, $n) == 0
    if quest(3, 5, $n) == 20
      if rand(20)
        say I hear a dragon in the mountains hides a magical suit of white and gold armor.
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog yes begin test~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 8
  say Very well, En Guarde!
  mpkill $n
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 9
endif
~
>speech_prog ready troops~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 15
  say They will be ready come spring.  We will send those
  say invaders back where they came from!
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 16
endif
~
>hitprcnt_prog 15~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 9
  peace
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 10
  say Very good $n!  You may tell the prince that you have
  say passed the test and are ready for his mission.
  mpquiet on
  cast heal self
  cast heal self
  cast heal self
  cast heal self
  cast heal self
  mpquiet off
endif
~
|
#1703
prince crydee~
the Prince of Crydee~
The Prince of Crydee is here.~
He is a thin man of average height and looks more like a thief or maybe an
artist than the son of a frontier duke.
~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
0 
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+12000 1d1+110
500000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 0
  if level($n) >= 90
    say Greetings $n,  I need a squire to run errands.
    say Would you care to be my squire?
    mpmset $n quest 3 5 1
  endif
else
  if quest(3, 5, $n) == 4
    say I need this letter carried to the Queen in Elvendar.
    mpjunk all
    mpoload 1719
    give i1719 $n
    mpmset $n quest 3 5 5
  else
    if quest(3, 5, $n) == 6
      say Now you must prepare yourself and prove you are
      say worthy of your next task.
      say Go see the swordmaster and he will test your
      say skills.
      mpmset $n quest 3 5 7
    else
      if quest(3, 5, $n) == 16
        say Ahh you are back, $n,  I have decided
        say that we will raid the invaders in the Green Heart
        say in order to take pressure off my father.
        say We will enter the Heart in small groups and
        say will not return until each man has killed two
        say invaders.  Go prepare your party now.
        mpmset $n quest 3 5 17
      else
        if quest(3, 5, $n) == 19
          say Your effort has insured our victory.
          say You can no longer be my squire.
          if sex($n) == 1
            say I dub thee Sir $n, Knight of the Kingdom.
            mpmset $n long Sir $n, Knight of the Kingdom.
          else
            say I dub thee Lady $n, Knight of the Kingdom.
            mpmset $n long Lady $n, Knight of the Kingdom.
          endif
          mpoload 1720
          mpquiet on
          cast 'giant strength' $n
          mpquiet off
          give i1720 $n
          mpjunk all
          mpmset $n quest 3 5 20
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 5~
if quest(0, 2, self) == 1
  mpmset self quest 0 2 0
  mpecho The prince leaves for Crydee.
  mpgoto 1709
  mpecho The prince has returned from Elvendar.
endif
~
>speech_prog dwarves grey towers~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 14
  say Excellent, I have persuaded the elves to join us
  say in battle as well.  Go tell the swordmaster to
  say ready our troops.
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 15
endif
~
>speech_prog reinforcements duke spring~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 12
  say Grave news indeed.  We will do as he says and win
  say this war!
  say Go to the Dwarves of Grey Towers and tell them the
  say Duke needs them with him by spring.  I will do
  say likewise with the elves.
  mpmset self quest 0 2 1
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 13
  mpecho The prince disappears through a door.
  mpgoto 1777
endif
~
>speech_prog yes yep sure ok yeah squire~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 1
  say Excellent!  While you are my squire you will
  say report to me for new duties anytime you finish
  say your existing tasks.  For now, The cook needs
  say help in the kitchen.  You are dismissed.
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 2
endif
~
>speech_prog no nope~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 1
  say Well get out of my castle then!
  mpecho Guards come in and drag you out.
  mptransfer $n 1706
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 31
endif
~
>speech_prog test mission ready~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 10
  smile
  say Just in time.  I have received a message from my
  say father, but it is too garbled to understand.
  say I need someone I trust to go over the mountains
  say and return with his message personally.
  say That is you, now go and good luck.
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 11
else
  say You are not ready for this difficult a task yet.
endif
~
|
