#1712
wraith~
a wraith~
A wraith haunts this place.~
It is very ethereal and glows with a slight radiance.  It was once a creature
that died in these tunnels and now seeks to have others join its fate.
~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_UNDEAD|ACT_AGGRESSIVE
0 
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+12000 1d1+120
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, self) == 0
  rescale 1712 $n 150
else
  if quest(0, 3, self) == 1
    rescale 1712 $n 160
  else
    if quest(0, 3, self) == 2
      rescale 1712 $n 170
    else
      if quest(0, 3, self) == 3
        rescale 1712 $n 180
      else
        if quest(0, 3, self) == 4
          rescale 1712 $n 190
        else
          if quest(0, 3, self) == 5
            mpjunk all
            rescale 1712 $n 200
            mpoload 1725
          endif
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>kill_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, self) == 5
  mpechoat $n You scream as the wraith drains all of your life force!
  mpechoaround $n The wraith drains $n completely and revels in its new power.
else
  if quest(0, 3, self) == 4
    if level($n) > 50
      mpjunk all
      rescale 1712 $n 200
      mpmset self quest 0 3 5
      mpoload 1725
    endif
    mpechoat $n You scream as the wraith drains all of your life force!
    mpechoaround $n The wraith drains $n completely and revels in its new power.
  else
    mpechoat $n You scream as the wraith drains all of your life force!
    mpechoaround $n The wraith drains $n completely and revels in its new power.
    if level($n) > 50
      mpmadd self quest 0 3 1
    endif
  endif
endif
mpareaecho You hear $n scream as $e is drained of all life by the wraith.
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 1
  mpecho The wraith lets out an unearthly shriek as it fades away.
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 2
endif
if quest(0, 3, self) == 5
  mpmset self quest 0 3 0
endif
~
>fight_prog 40~
mpechoat $n The wraith nears with its life draining touch.
mpquiet on
cast 'energy drain' $n
cast 'energy drain' $n
mpquiet off
~
>rand_prog 5~
mpasound You hear a low moaning from nearby.
mpecho The wraith lets out a low moan.
~
