#ROOMS
#1700
Crydee Beach~
{030}This sandy beach is edged with cliff to the east.  Looking to the west you
can see all the way to the horizon across the Gulf of the East.  The beach
is full of little tide pools through which small creatures swim.
~
17 0 SECT_DESERT
DDIR_EAST
~
~
0 -1 1701
DDIR_WEST
~
~
0 -1 1793
S
#1701
Path to the Beach~
This path is slightly wooded as it winds its way east and west between the 
town of crydee in the east and its beach to the west.  Ruts in the road show
that wagons are used to carry freight down to the beach to be loaded onto ships
destined for exotic ports.
~
17 0 SECT_FIELD
DDIR_WEST
~
~
0 -1 1700
DDIR_EAST
~
~
0 -1 1702 
S
#1702
The Crydee road~
This is the only road through the town of Crydee.  Much of it has been pounded
hard by the tramp of many feet but you must occasionally dodge puddles and mud.
To the west the roads worsens as it heads toward the beach.
~
17 0 SECT_CITY
DDIR_WEST
~
~
0 -1 1701
DDIR_EAST
~
~
0 -1 1703 
S
#1703
The Crydee road~
This is the only road through the town of Crydee.  Much of it has been pounded
hard by the tramp of many feet but you must occasionally dodge puddles and mud.
The sides of the road are lined with boardwalks here where they lead to small
shops.
