#1704
The Crydee Road~
This is the only road through the town of Crydee.  Much of it has been pounded
hard by the tramp of many feet but you must occasionally dodge puddles and mud.
{300}Shops line the sides of the street here as the road worsens to the east at 
the edge of town.
~
17 0 SECT_CITY
DDIR_WEST
~
~
0 -1 1705 
DDIR_NORTH
~
~
0 -1 1711 
DDIR_EAST
~
~
0 -1 1712
S
#1705
Crydee Square~
This is the central meeting place in the town of Crydee.  It is where most
citizens of the town meet to discuss daily events and is the most direct
route to Castle Crydee to the south.
~
17 ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_ALTAR_N SECT_CITY
DDIR_EAST
~
~
