#1709
Duke's Chambers~
These chambers are occupied by the duke of Crydee.  For the rank of a duke,
these rooms seem barely appointed to suit a squire although they far outshine
that of any commoner.
~
17 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_DOWN
~
~
