S
#1710
Crydee Blacksmith~
This small hut contains all the implements needed by the blacksmith of the
town of Crydee to work his trade.  Among other things you notice a small forge
and an anvil.  It is a bit warm in here.
~
17 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
~
~
0 -1 1703
S
#1711
Crydee General Store~
This small building is crammed with all sorts of goods, from foodstuffs to
tents.  The wooden walls of the structure are covered with shelves to help
make some order out of the mess but they do not succeed.
~
17 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
~
~
