#1792
Crydee Kitchen~
This kitchen is nestled inside the keep of Castle Crydee.  Its stone walls
radiate warmth from the cooking fires that are constantly going.  Large
wooden tables line the walls where the cook prepares food and most of them
are scarred from various knives.~
17 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
